Package: rrad
Type: Package
OS_type: unix
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Title: R Interface and Toolkit for Read-Agnostic Demultiplexing
Version: 1.1.0
Date: 2026-09-02
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Chinmay",
    family = "Vaidya",
    email = "chinmay.m.vaidya.GR@dartmouth.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Provides an embedded build of the read-agnostic demultiplexer
    ('RAD') together with streaming and compact read storage for R.
    Demultiplexing, barcode-whitelist discovery, and tagged-read reformatting
    run in-process. Compatible RAD layouts and small whitelists are included;
    large built-in whitelists are downloaded automatically when first needed,
    verified, and reused on later runs. No separate command-line installation
    is required.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Imports:
    bit64,
    data.table,
    digest,
    Rcpp (>= 1.0.9)
LinkingTo:
    BH,
    Rcpp
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
SystemRequirements: C++17, zlib
Config/testthat/edition: 3
